# 強制終了 (design 5.5.1, 5.5.3, 5.5.5), for tools/ui_run.py. A program with a window
# (SVCPROG.ELF 25 opens "ktpause") is ended with Shift+Pause: its window is in front
# but has not been given the keys, and the window in front is the one meant. One with
# no window (SVCPROG.ELF 33) is chosen in the window 強制終了 (Ctrl+Shift+Pause; End
# chooses the last row, the newest process) and ended with 〈強制終了〉. The window is
# a window of panels from the data box 強制終了のデータボックス, at 352,142 on the
# 1280x800 screen of the test, its work area from 360,170: 〈強制終了〉 at 760,490,
# 〈デスクトップを立ち上げ直す〉 at 492,490. The second button over it opens its menu
# (the common 閉じる, its own items, ウインドウ・小物・実行); Esc puts the menu away.
# 〈デスクトップを立ち上げ直す〉 asks first in a panel that warns, over the middle of
# the window: 〈立ち上げ直す〉 at 696,391 starts the desktop again, which comes up
# with its cabinet while the window stays. Ctrl+Shift+Pause closes the window.
run /boot/SVCPROG.ELF 25
win ktpause
wait 300
key 48 02
expect を強制終了しました
run /boot/SVCPROG.ELF 33
wait 500
key 48 03
expect the window is up
win 強制終了
wait 1500
shot fq_window
key 4d
wait 300
click 760 490
expect を強制終了しました
wait 1500
shot fq_ended
click 640 300 1
wait 800
shot fq_menu
key 29
wait 300
click 492 490
expect asked whether to start the desktop again
wait 800
shot fq_confirm
click 696 391
expect デスクトップを立ち上げ直しました
wait 2500
shot fq_restarted
key 48 03
wait 500
wins
shot fq_after
absent !EXCEPTION!
absent !STACK!
